# SE2CAD third-party assets

This is a public repository. Apache-2.0 applies to SE2CAD-owned code and documentation only. It does not relicense Space Engineers, Keen Software House, Microsoft, SolidWorks/Dassault, Blender, or other third-party assets.

## Do not commit

- Space Engineers game assets
- Keen ModSDK FBX files
- MWM models, textures, or extracted proprietary geometry
- SolidWorks content not created for SE2CAD
- Redistributable-status-unknown third-party binaries

SE2CAD may contain code and metadata that locates, identifies, parses, or transforms assets from a user's legitimate local installation where that is lawful and in scope.

## Derived geometry

Do not assume CAD output is publicly redistributable because SE2CAD generated it or because this repo is Apache-2.0. Distributing canonical parts derived from Keen assets requires an explicit human licensing decision.

User-authored blueprint fixtures may be committed when provenance is recorded. Game/SDK geometry must not be embedded in those fixtures.

## Stop

If redistribution rights are uncertain, stop and ask the human architect. Do not add the file.

Authoritative policy: [ADR-004](docs/technical/adr/ADR-004_THIRD_PARTY_ASSET_BOUNDARY.md).
